msgid "Only a private proxy change names a proxy."
msgstr "只有开通或取消私有代理时才指定代理。"

msgid "Choose a private proxy."
msgstr "请选择一个私有代理。"

#, python-format
msgid "%(proxy)s is not a private proxy."
msgstr "%(proxy)s 不是私有代理。"

#, python-format
msgid "%(name)s may use %(proxy)s already."
msgstr "%(name)s 已经可以使用 %(proxy)s。"

#, python-format
msgid "%(name)s was not given %(proxy)s."
msgstr "%(name)s 没有被授予 %(proxy)s。"

msgid "Unknown operation."
msgstr "未知操作。"

msgid ""
"Invalid account name: lowercase letters, digits, '.', '_' and '-', starting "
"with a letter or digit, at most 64 characters; svc- only as svc-docker-"
"<node>."
msgstr "账号名无效：只能包含小写字母、数字、'.'、'_' 和 '-'，以字母或数字开头，最多 64 个字符；svc- 只能用于 svc-docker-<node>。"

#, python-format
msgid "%(name)s can only be changed outside the portal."
msgstr "%(name)s 只能在门户之外修改。"

msgid ""
"Account information is unavailable right now, so no change can be requested."
msgstr "账号信息暂时不可用，无法提交变更。"

#, python-format
msgid "The account %(name)s exists."
msgstr "账号 %(name)s 已存在。"

#, python-format
msgid "There is no account %(name)s."
msgstr "没有账号 %(name)s。"

msgid "A service account cannot be an admin account."
msgstr "服务账号不能成为管理员账号。"

msgid "A service account cannot be given a private proxy."
msgstr "服务账号不能被授予私有代理。"

#, python-format
msgid "%(name)s is an admin account: it may use every private proxy already."
msgstr "%(name)s 是管理员账号：已经可以使用所有私有代理。"

msgid "The request could not be saved. Nothing changed."
msgstr "无法保存请求。没有任何变更。"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Applying restarts %(proxy)s. Established connections through it drop, and "
"new ones fail for a few seconds."
msgstr "应用时会重启 %(proxy)s。经过它的已建立连接会断开，新连接会有几秒失败。"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Applying restarts no proxy: the change takes effect at %(proxy)s once the "
"account's proxy access is on and it is not an admin account."
msgstr "应用时不会重启任何代理：等该账号的代理访问开启、且它不是管理员账号时，变更才会在 %(proxy)s 生效。"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Applying restarts the Auto-switching Proxy, every public proxy but %(open)s, "
"and %(proxies)s. Established connections through them drop, and new ones "
"fail for a few seconds."
msgstr "应用时会重启自动切换代理、除 %(open)s 以外的所有公共代理和 %(proxies)s。经过它们的已建立连接会断开，新连接会有几秒失败。"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Applying restarts the Auto-switching Proxy, every public proxy and "
"%(proxies)s. Established connections through them drop, and new ones fail "
"for a few seconds."
msgstr "应用时会重启自动切换代理、所有公共代理和 %(proxies)s。经过它们的已建立连接会断开，新连接会有几秒失败。"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Applying restarts the Auto-switching Proxy and %(proxies)s. Established "
"connections through them drop, and new ones fail for a few seconds."
msgstr "应用时会重启自动切换代理和 %(proxies)s。经过它们的已建立连接会断开，新连接会有几秒失败。"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Applying restarts the Auto-switching Proxy and every public proxy but "
"%(open)s. Established connections through them drop, and new ones fail for a "
"few seconds."
msgstr "应用时会重启自动切换代理和除 %(open)s 以外的所有公共代理。经过它们的已建立连接会断开，新连接会有几秒失败。"

msgid ""
"Applying restarts the Auto-switching Proxy and every public proxy. "
"Established connections through them drop, and new ones fail for a few "
"seconds."
msgstr "应用时会重启自动切换代理和所有公共代理。经过它们的已建立连接会断开，新连接会有几秒失败。"

msgid ""
"Applying restarts the Auto-switching Proxy. Established connections through "
"it drop, and new ones fail for a few seconds."
msgstr "应用时会重启自动切换代理。经过它的已建立连接会断开，新连接会有几秒失败。"

#, python-format
msgid "both auto-switching proxies and every proxy but %(open)s"
msgstr "两个自动切换代理和除 %(open)s 以外的所有代理"

msgid "both auto-switching proxies and every proxy"
msgstr "两个自动切换代理和所有代理"

msgid "both auto-switching proxies and the private proxies"
msgstr "两个自动切换代理和私有代理"

#, python-format
msgid "both auto-switching proxies and %(proxies)s"
msgstr "两个自动切换代理和 %(proxies)s"

msgid "both auto-switching proxies"
msgstr "两个自动切换代理"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Applying restarts %(services)s. Established connections through them drop, "
"and new ones fail for a few seconds."
msgstr "应用时会重启 %(services)s。经过它们的已建立连接会断开，新连接会有几秒失败。"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Lets %(name)s use the private proxy %(proxy)s at its own address. The "
"Private Auto-switching Proxy and the other private proxies still refuse it."
msgstr "允许 %(name)s 通过私有代理 %(proxy)s 自己的地址使用它。私有自动切换代理和其他私有代理仍会拒绝它。"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(proxy)s stops accepting %(name)s. Nothing else changes for the account."
msgstr "%(proxy)s 不再接受 %(name)s。该账号的其他访问不变。"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(name)s stops being an admin account: the Private Auto-switching Proxy and "
"the private proxies refuse it, except %(proxies)s, which it was given."
msgstr "%(name)s 不再是管理员账号：私有自动切换代理和私有代理会拒绝它，已授予它的 %(proxies)s 除外。"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Creates the proxy account %(name)s with a new random password, which you see "
"once when the change is live. It may use the Auto-switching Proxy and the "
"public proxies."
msgstr "创建代理账号 %(name)s 并生成随机密码，变更生效后你可以查看一次密码。该账号可以使用自动切换代理和公共代理。"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Gives %(name)s a new random password, which you see once when it is live. "
"The old password stops working."
msgstr "为 %(name)s 生成新的随机密码，生效后你可以查看一次。旧密码随即失效。"

#, python-format
msgid "Turns proxy access on for %(name)s, with its current password."
msgstr "为 %(name)s 开启代理访问，密码不变。"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Turns proxy access off for %(name)s. The account and its password are kept: "
"turning it on again restores it."
msgstr "关闭 %(name)s 的代理访问。账号和密码会保留：重新开启即可恢复。"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Removes the account %(name)s and its password. Adding it again gives it a "
"new password."
msgstr "删除账号 %(name)s 及其密码。重新添加会得到新密码。"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Makes %(name)s an admin account: it may also use the Private Auto-switching "
"Proxy and the private proxies. This is the proxy account's flag, not the "
"Determined admin role."
msgstr "将 %(name)s 设为管理员账号：还可以使用私有自动切换代理和私有代理。这是代理账号的标记，不是 Determined 管理员角色。"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(name)s stops being an admin account: the Private Auto-switching Proxy and "
"the private proxies refuse it."
msgstr "%(name)s 不再是管理员账号：私有自动切换代理和私有代理会拒绝它。"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"The public proxies' own addresses require an account, except those of "
"%(open)s, which need none: an account whose proxy access is off is refused "
"everywhere else."
msgstr "公共代理自己的地址需要账号，%(open)s 的地址除外（无需账号）：已关闭代理访问的账号在其他地址都会被拒绝。"

msgid ""
"The public proxies' own addresses require an account: an account whose proxy "
"access is off is refused at every proxy."
msgstr "公共代理自己的地址需要账号：已关闭代理访问的账号会被所有代理拒绝。"

msgid ""
"The public proxies' own addresses need no account: proxy access off stops "
"only the auto-switching proxies and the private proxies, and a public "
"proxy's own address still works for that user."
msgstr "公共代理自己的地址无需账号：关闭代理访问只会让两个自动切换代理和私有代理拒绝该账号，该用户仍可使用公共代理自己的地址。"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(open)s needs no account at its own address even when the public proxies "
"require one."
msgid_plural ""
"%(open)s need no account at their own addresses even when the public proxies "
"require one."
msgstr[0] "即使公共代理需要账号，%(open)s 自己的地址也无需账号。"

#, python-format
msgid "There is no private proxy to choose for %(name)s."
msgstr "没有可为 %(name)s 选择的私有代理。"

msgid "Type the account name to confirm."
msgstr "请输入账号名确认。"

msgid "Status unknown: no recent probe results for the Auto-switching Proxy"
msgstr "状态未知：自动切换代理近期没有探测结果"

msgid "Auto-switching Proxy available"
msgstr "自动切换代理可用"

#, python-format
msgid "Auto-switching Proxy available; its %(n)d public proxy is passing"
msgid_plural "Auto-switching Proxy available; all %(n)d public proxies passing"
msgstr[0] "自动切换代理可用；公共代理正常（共 %(n)d 个）"

msgid "Auto-switching Proxy answering, but no public proxy passes its probe"
msgstr "自动切换代理有响应，但没有公共代理通过探测"

msgid ""
"Auto-switching Proxy available on its last passing public proxy, without a "
"spare"
msgstr "自动切换代理仅剩一个正常的公共代理，没有备用"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Auto-switching Proxy available; %(n)d public proxy not passing, switching "
"still works"
msgid_plural ""
"Auto-switching Proxy available; %(n)d public proxies not passing, switching "
"still works"
msgstr[0] "自动切换代理可用；%(n)d 个公共代理未通过探测，切换仍然正常"

msgid "Auto-switching Proxy failing while public proxies pass"
msgstr "自动切换代理故障，但公共代理正常"

msgid "Auto-switching Proxy failing: no public proxy passes its probe"
msgstr "自动切换代理故障：没有公共代理通过探测"

msgid "Auto-switching Proxy failing"
msgstr "自动切换代理故障"

msgid "Auto-switching Proxy: HTTP failing, SOCKS5 still available"
msgstr "自动切换代理：HTTP 故障，SOCKS5 仍可用"

msgid "Auto-switching Proxy: SOCKS5 failing, HTTP still available"
msgstr "自动切换代理：SOCKS5 故障，HTTP 仍可用"

msgid "Auto-switching Proxy: HTTP available, SOCKS5 status unknown"
msgstr "自动切换代理：HTTP 可用，SOCKS5 状态未知"

msgid "Auto-switching Proxy: SOCKS5 available, HTTP status unknown"
msgstr "自动切换代理：SOCKS5 可用，HTTP 状态未知"

msgid "Auto-switching Proxy: HTTP failing, SOCKS5 status unknown"
msgstr "自动切换代理：HTTP 故障，SOCKS5 状态未知"

msgid "Auto-switching Proxy: SOCKS5 failing, HTTP status unknown"
msgstr "自动切换代理：SOCKS5 故障，HTTP 状态未知"

msgctxt "request stage"
msgid "Request check"
msgstr "检查请求"

msgctxt "request stage"
msgid "Reading the accounts"
msgstr "读取账号"

msgctxt "request stage"
msgid "Checks before applying"
msgstr "应用前检查"

msgctxt "request stage"
msgid "Preparing the settings"
msgstr "准备配置"

msgctxt "request stage"
msgid "Testing the settings"
msgstr "测试配置"

msgctxt "request stage"
msgid "Backup"
msgstr "备份"

msgctxt "request stage"
msgid "Replacing the settings"
msgstr "替换配置"

msgctxt "request stage"
msgid "Restarting the proxies"
msgstr "重启代理"

msgctxt "request stage"
msgid "Verifying"
msgstr "验证"

msgctxt "request stage"
msgid "Recording the result"
msgstr "记录结果"

msgctxt "request stage"
msgid "Interrupted"
msgstr "已中断"

#, python-format
msgid "%(first)s %(second)s"
msgstr "%(first)s%(second)s"

msgid "Waiting to be applied: the old access still works."
msgstr "等待应用：原有访问仍然有效。"

msgid "Waiting to be applied."
msgstr "等待应用。"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Not started after %(n)d minutes: the service that applies account changes "
"may not be running."
msgstr "%(n)d 分钟后仍未开始：应用账号变更的服务可能没有运行。"

msgid ""
"Being applied; the affected proxies restart. Until the change is confirmed, "
"the old access may still work."
msgstr "正在应用，受影响的代理会重启。变更确认之前，原有访问可能仍然有效。"

msgid "Being applied; the affected proxies restart."
msgstr "正在应用，受影响的代理会重启。"

msgid ""
"Nothing to change: the account was already in that state. The proxies "
"restarted to apply other changes."
msgstr "无需变更：账号已处于该状态。代理为应用其他变更而重启。"

msgid ""
"Nothing to change: the account was already in that state. Nothing restarted."
msgstr "无需变更：账号已处于该状态。没有重启任何服务。"

msgid "Applied and verified."
msgstr "已应用并验证。"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Live, but not confirmed yet: %(proxy)s or the auto-switching proxies did not "
"answer the checks in time, or %(proxy)s is not running."
msgstr "已生效，但尚未确认：%(proxy)s 或自动切换代理没有及时响应检查，或者 %(proxy)s 没有在运行。"

msgid ""
"Live: the proxies refuse the old access (verified), but no proxy answered "
"the checks that must pass in time, so the proxies may not be passing traffic "
"right now."
msgstr "已生效：代理已拒绝原有访问（已验证），但应当通过的检查在超时内没有代理响应，代理目前可能无法转发流量。"

msgid ""
"Live: the old password is refused (verified). The new password is not "
"confirmed yet: no proxy answered in time."
msgstr "已生效：旧密码已被拒绝（已验证）。新密码尚未确认：超时内没有代理响应。"

msgid ""
"Live, but not confirmed yet: no proxy answered the new login in time (the "
"proxies may be down)."
msgstr "已生效，但尚未确认：超时内没有代理响应新的登录（代理可能不可用）。"

msgid "The request was refused. Nothing changed."
msgstr "请求被拒绝。没有任何变更。"

msgid ""
"Failed, and the previous settings could not be fully restored: the affected "
"proxies may be down or in a mixed state. Check the log of the proxy-apply "
"service (journalctl -u proxy-apply)."
msgstr "失败，且未能完全恢复之前的配置：受影响的代理可能不可用或处于混合状态。请查看 proxy-apply 服务的日志 (journalctl -u proxy-apply)。"

msgid ""
"Failed; the previous state is back: the account is unchanged and the old "
"access still works."
msgstr "失败，已恢复到之前的状态：账号未变更，原有访问仍然有效。"

msgid "Failed; the previous state is back: the account is unchanged."
msgstr "失败，已恢复到之前的状态：账号未变更。"

msgid "The affected proxies restarted: established connections dropped."
msgstr "受影响的代理已重启：已建立的连接已断开。"

msgid "The new password is handed out once the change is live."
msgstr "变更生效后才会提供新密码。"

msgid ""
"The new password is ready. It is shown once, to you only, and then deleted."
msgstr "新密码已就绪。它只显示一次，仅对你可见，随后即被删除。"

#, python-format
msgid "Only %(admin)s, who made this request, can see the new password."
msgstr "只有提交该请求的 %(admin)s 可以查看新密码。"

msgid ""
"The password was shown once; the portal does not keep it. For a new one, "
"request a new password."
msgstr "该密码已显示过一次，门户不会保存它。如需新密码，请再申请一次新密码。"

msgid ""
"The one-time password expired: it is kept for 10 minutes only. For a new "
"one, request a new password."
msgstr "一次性密码已过期：它只保留 10 分钟。如需新密码，请再申请一次新密码。"

msgid ""
"No password was handed out for this request. For a new one, request a new "
"password."
msgstr "这个请求没有提供密码。如需新密码，请再申请一次新密码。"

msgid ""
"The one-time password could not be read and was deleted. For a new one, "
"request a new password."
msgstr "无法读取一次性密码，已将其删除。如需新密码，请再申请一次新密码。"

msgid "No password: the change was not applied."
msgstr "没有密码：变更未应用。"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"The account was removed by request %(id)s: this password no longer works."
msgstr "该账号已被请求 %(id)s 删除：此密码已失效。"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"A later request replaced this password: use the password of request %(id)s."
msgstr "之后的请求替换了这个密码：请使用请求 %(id)s 的密码。"

msgctxt "incident component"
msgid "Auto-switching Proxy"
msgstr "自动切换代理"

msgctxt "incident component"
msgid "Private Auto-switching Proxy"
msgstr "私有自动切换代理"

msgctxt "incident component"
msgid "Individual proxies"
msgstr "各个代理"

msgctxt "incident component"
msgid "Monitoring"
msgstr "监控"

msgctxt "incident component"
msgid "Portal"
msgstr "门户"

msgctxt "incident state"
msgid "Investigating"
msgstr "调查中"

msgctxt "incident state"
msgid "Identified"
msgstr "已定位"

msgctxt "incident state"
msgid "Monitoring"
msgstr "观察中"

msgctxt "incident state"
msgid "Resolved"
msgstr "已恢复"

msgctxt "incident state"
msgid "Maintenance"
msgstr "维护"

msgctxt "account op"
msgid "Add"
msgstr "添加"

msgctxt "account op"
msgid "New password"
msgstr "新密码"

msgctxt "account op"
msgid "Turn on"
msgstr "开启访问"

msgctxt "account op"
msgid "Turn off"
msgstr "关闭访问"

msgctxt "account op"
msgid "Remove"
msgstr "删除"

msgctxt "account op"
msgid "Admin account on"
msgstr "设为管理员账号"

msgctxt "account op"
msgid "Admin account off"
msgstr "取消管理员账号"

msgctxt "account op"
msgid "Private proxy on"
msgstr "开通私有代理"

msgctxt "account op"
msgid "Private proxy off"
msgstr "取消私有代理"

msgctxt "request state"
msgid "Pending"
msgstr "等待中"

msgctxt "request state"
msgid "Applying"
msgstr "应用中"

msgctxt "request state"
msgid "Applied"
msgstr "已应用"

msgctxt "request state"
msgid "Failed"
msgstr "失败"

msgctxt "request state"
msgid "Unconfirmed"
msgstr "未确认"

msgid "Account information is unavailable right now. Try again later."
msgstr "账号信息暂时无法获取，请稍后再试。"

msgid "There is no proxy account named after your Determined username."
msgstr "没有以你的 Determined 用户名命名的代理账号。"

msgid ""
"Password reset is unavailable while proxy access is off for your account. "
"Ask an admin to turn it on."
msgstr "你的账号已关闭代理访问，无法重置密码。请联系管理员开启。"

msgid ""
"A change to your account is still waiting or being applied. Try again once "
"it is done."
msgstr "你的账号还有一项变更在等待或正在应用，完成后再试。"

#, python-format
msgid "You can reset your password %(n)d time per hour. Try again later."
msgid_plural ""
"You can reset your password %(n)d times per hour. Try again later."
msgstr[0] "每小时最多可以重置 %(n)d 次密码，请稍后再试。"

msgid ""
"Failed, and the previous settings could not be fully restored: the proxies "
"may be down. Tell an admin."
msgstr "失败，且未能完全恢复之前的配置：代理可能不可用。请告知管理员。"

msgid "The account was removed: this password no longer works."
msgstr "该账号已被删除：此密码已失效。"

msgid ""
"A later change to your account replaced this password: it no longer works. "
"Reset it again, or ask an admin."
msgstr "之后的一项变更替换了此密码，它已失效。请再次重置，或联系管理员。"

msgid ""
"The password was shown once; the portal does not keep it. To get a new one, "
"reset it again."
msgstr "该密码已显示过一次，门户不会保存它。如需新密码，请再次重置。"

msgid ""
"The one-time password expired: it is kept for 10 minutes only. To get a new "
"one, reset it again."
msgstr "一次性密码已过期：它只保留 10 分钟。如需新密码，请再次重置。"

msgid ""
"No password was handed out for this reset. To get a new one, reset it again."
msgstr "此次重置没有发放密码。如需新密码，请再次重置。"

msgid ""
"The one-time password could not be read and was deleted. To get a new one, "
"reset it again."
msgstr "无法读取一次性密码，已将其删除。如需新密码，请再次重置。"

msgid "Something went wrong"
msgstr "出错了"

msgid "The portal could not show this page. Try again later."
msgstr "门户无法显示此页面，请稍后再试。"

msgid "Go to the status page"
msgstr "前往服务状态页"

msgid "96 hours ago"
msgstr "96 小时前"

msgid "30 days ago"
msgstr "30 天前"

msgid "Unknown or too little data"
msgstr "未知或数据不足"

msgid "Now"
msgstr "现在"

msgid "Proxy"
msgstr "代理"

msgid "Ports"
msgstr "端口"

msgid "Latency"
msgstr "延迟"

msgid "24 h success"
msgstr "24 小时成功率"

msgid "Last check"
msgstr "最近检查"

