msgid "Auto-switching High-availability Proxies"
msgstr "自动切换高可用代理"

msgid "One address each; every new connection goes to a passing proxy."
msgstr "各有一个固定地址；每个新连接都发往一个正常的代理。"

msgid "Status bars"
msgstr "状态条"

msgid "96 hours"
msgstr "96 小时"

msgid "30 days"
msgstr "30 天"

msgid ""
"Each proxy probed at its own address. A proxy's own address does not switch: "
"when it fails, use the Auto-switching Proxy."
msgstr "每个代理都在它自己的地址上探测。代理自己的地址不会切换：代理故障时请使用自动切换代理。"

msgid "Public proxies"
msgstr "公共代理"

msgid "No proxy results"
msgstr "没有代理结果"

msgid "Ports, latency and 24 h success: HTTP / SOCKS5."
msgstr "端口、延迟和 24 小时成功率：HTTP / SOCKS5。"

msgid "Latency, 24 h success and last check: on a wider screen."
msgstr "延迟、24 小时成功率和最近检查：请在更宽的屏幕上查看。"

msgid "Notices from the admins about outages and maintenance."
msgstr "管理员发布的故障和维护通知。"

msgid "No incidents in the last 30 days"
msgstr "过去 30 天没有事件"

msgid "Reading the status"
msgstr "如何理解状态"

msgid "What the probes show, and what they do not."
msgstr "探测能说明什么，不能说明什么。"

msgid "The service works but you cannot connect"
msgstr "服务正常但你无法连接"

msgid ""
"Check My access: whether you have an account, whether its proxy access is "
"on, and the address for your network. The probes do not cover the network "
"path from your machine to the proxies."
msgstr "请查看“我的接入”：你是否有账号、代理访问是否开启，以及你所在网络的地址。探测不覆盖从你的机器到代理的网络路径。"

msgid "Automatic switching"
msgstr "自动切换"

msgid ""
"An auto-switching proxy chooses a passing proxy for each new connection, "
"within about 15 seconds of a proxy failing. Open downloads, SSH sessions and "
"WebSockets stay on their proxy and break with it; the client has to retry."
msgstr "代理故障后约 15 秒内，每个自动切换代理都会为新连接选择正常的代理。已建立的下载、SSH 会话和 WebSocket 留在原代理上，会随之中断，需要客户端重试。"

msgid ""
"No probe result in the last 90 seconds. An older result is never shown in "
"its place."
msgstr "最近 90 秒内没有探测结果；不会用更早的结果代替。"

msgid "My proxy usage"
msgstr "我的代理流量"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Observed traffic of the account %(name)s, counted at the address you connect "
"to: the auto-switching proxies, and a proxy's own address when it requires "
"an account. Traffic through a proxy's own address without an account is "
"counted under no user."
msgstr "账号 %(name)s 的观测流量，按你连接的地址计数：各自动切换代理，以及需要账号时代理自己的地址。不带账号经代理自己的地址产生的流量不计入任何用户。"

msgid "Usage data is unavailable right now. Try again later."
msgstr "流量数据暂时不可用，请稍后再试。"

msgid "Observed totals"
msgstr "观测总量"

msgid ""
"Download and upload through the proxies over the last 24 hours, 7 days and "
"30 days."
msgstr "最近 24 小时、7 天和 30 天经代理的下载和上传流量。"

msgid "Last 24 hours"
msgstr "最近 24 小时"

msgid "Last 7 days"
msgstr "最近 7 天"

msgid "Last 30 days"
msgstr "最近 30 天"

msgid "Download"
msgstr "下载"

msgid "Upload"
msgstr "上传"

msgid "No traffic observed"
msgstr "未观测到流量"

msgid "Trend"
msgstr "趋势"

msgid ""
"Download and upload per hour (24 hours), per 6 hours (7 days) and per day "
"(30 days)."
msgstr "下载和上传：每小时（24 小时）、每 6 小时（7 天）、每天（30 天）。"

msgid "Range"
msgstr "时间范围"

msgid "24 hours"
msgstr "24 小时"

msgid "7 days"
msgstr "7 天"

#, python-format
msgid "Traffic per bucket; the highest bucket is %(peak)s."
msgstr "每个时间段的流量；最高的时间段为 %(peak)s。"

#, python-format
msgid "Highest bar: %(peak)s"
msgstr "最高：%(peak)s"

msgid "Notes"
msgstr "说明"

msgid ""
"These are observed totals, not a bill or a quota. They include traffic to "
"private addresses and destinations in China. Counters restart when a proxy "
"restarts, as after an account change, so a little traffic before a restart "
"can be missing, and a total built from few samples can read high."
msgstr "这些是观测总量，不是账单或配额，包括访问内网和国内目标的流量。代理重启时（例如账号变更后）计数器归零，因此重启前的少量流量可能缺失，样本很少时的总量可能偏高。"

msgid "Only the signed-in user's own usage is shown."
msgstr "这里只显示当前登录用户自己的流量。"

msgctxt "list separator"
msgid ", "
msgstr "、"

